{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411060","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1341106001:1":{"text":"カタストロフに対抗するため、死神様によって生み出されたグレイヴボーンの戦士が、この国の屍たちの正体だったとは……","source_cn":"真没想到，白山的活死人竟然是死神大人为了对抗恶魔而创造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EDD2AF443CBAD5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341106002:1":{"text":"二千年という時の中で、彼ら自身ですら己の過去を忘れたというのに、君たちが彼らの物語を見つけてくれたおかげで、この国の守護者だった、真の英雄たちの名誉は守られたんだ。","source_cn":"两千年过去，连活死人自己都将他们的过去遗忘了。但还好，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD928BABA3E43D959","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341106003:1":{"text":"フェルガルドさん、あなたは今も、グレイヴボーンの存在は自然の秩序に反していると思っているのですか？","source_cn":"那么，法拉莫尔先生还是觉得亡灵的存在有悖于自然秩序吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8BB539EC2027D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341106004:1":{"text":"どうだろうな……もしかしたら、グレイヴボーンはもとより秩序の影にいるのかもしれない。光と影は、どれも自然の一部だ。","source_cn":"谁知道呢……也许亡灵天生就藏在自然秩序的阴影中。而光与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19318909160C8C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341106005:1":{"text":"影そのものは、悪ではない。","source_cn":"阴影并不代表罪恶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF93F220A6F47FACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_mal